{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>動漫節ACGHK 2025 Cosplayer、Show Girls 美圖集｜一年一度的香港動漫電玩節（ACGHK2026）由 7 月 24 日至 28 日假香港會議展覽中心盛大舉行。今年除了動漫節展覽廳Hall 1及創天綜合同人祭的Hall 3外，今次更難得擴張Hall 5為cosplayer專用場地！場地更大，更多動漫、cosplayer都可以參予其中！記者就在第二日Day 2為大家現場直擊，為大家更新最新Cosplayer、Show Girls美圖集，就算因為打風或沒有時間前往現場，都可以感受現場氣氛。</p><p>動漫節2026門票👉👉01空間購買動漫節門票，用Payme再減$2</p><p>．創天綜合同人祭 Hall 3</p><figure><img alt=\"來自韓國的cosplayer Kim Seo Hyeon @seohwyl\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816561143123968125364.jpeg/fgwv-_fBrOW-cG7MNJqeTMfa_msXcPzUObPOvzmzzr8\"/><figcaption>來自韓國的cosplayer Kim Seo Hyeon @seohwyl</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"筱望 @siumong63\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816564460949504305267.jpeg/d2PJYZyCupP4OB6YFj1nU7Wn2ksvQe9HxhK_mcYSv5k\"/><figcaption>筱望 @siumong63</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"安琪ONKI @chariss_ego\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816571042074624587190.jpeg/NeFGHAxXiWRM8qUMBs6xB-GfEfLFyDwVSCa_6kgmv-o\"/><figcaption>安琪ONKI @chariss_ego</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"青鳥 @helloleeholeehoho\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816567707471872625038.jpeg/N6d7n7hZNHHTWpYFvaJGLPuZyZCkbtRyyE7HschOx7E\"/><figcaption>青鳥 @helloleeholeehoho</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816923493240832285173.jpeg/J2FrOHZ_UVmA5yY6-Kp3URsIVp10J17OTNO3r0zTt68\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816926576185344206135.jpeg/9F7F36yFtnyDiW9UpPsZMH1M2cIlae4Iibx60Im8etA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816929684295680896251.jpeg/pqKpFsHqBqbQMZLaOjxKm6Zc-aoMNu-sXuMNsV7jDbE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816932846931968781932.jpeg/s4vAZc-isE6Sgxbbyl5q2GmzJXtOZ4E7BWcDhQVnA4U\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816935820824576603274.jpeg/UfF-dV7xcxR4LVsB2MAv2uFghzGdgUa_QZ8pMUGfKTE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816923493240832147296.jpeg/jXJ2ZURiioe1ma7r_9kXle1Sh5aWXhFEF9ETvRfRE70\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816926546825216417825.jpeg/leUk1uZiBxGyV8lmw0Oq-MbWMOr59w2NLAgMeiwIDHo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816929650741248182506.jpeg/zKogFDOANFutwrC7s5d50XeA2A2FAxkVfvA_G37wPxs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816932767240192324091.jpeg/HEypjXUp9EFlR5GGbo5_OmI5993sxjVCKh09HiodPR4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816935871156224487230.jpeg/cZnzLEfRegtWx3bmKr8fZ4Vbz0JJbDuissncjLLJ3Iw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157816923107364864740568.jpeg/lZXreFmAbImmLXTOW02gL0DNM-yUHj5hDf9hkA3_YZA\"/><p>ACGHK入場點買飛最抵？PayMe支付$2現金回贈</p><p>01空間買動漫節2026門票，用PayMe俾錢 買滿$20即享$2現金回贈\n使用限期：即日到7月31日\n*每個 PayMe 戶口最多享用2次</p><p>ACGHK全票價錢：$50\n長者/傷健人士：12pm經1B通道進場,長者需出示樂悠咭,每位長者或傷健人士可由1位持票成年人陪同\n可進場館：Hall 1,3,5\n01空間👉🏻獨家$43入場</p><p>小童全票：$25\n*3-11歲(2歲或以下免費) 必須由18歲或以上之持票人士陪同(最多2位)\n可進場館：Hall 1,3,5\n01空間👉🏻獨家$23入場</p><p>．Cosplayer 專區 Hall 5</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817480375177216078129.jpeg/iu_RByqvZwC_Ec4vLNlcZxOPZeuwF6Gm-SEOd_khDnc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817493344489472394710.jpeg/Qmozu63qKJ24nhmfpEwK_BYjNgQFhXu2hKPN4YSjzeE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817490039246848539817.jpeg/fMvw4me-RZX5XNEgS67yUZf-yB_5GVlERYcH4kWHB-I\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817486830473216640532.jpeg/MB36sA0MwIiclrCsBgfuHkCSJIwXVKGiUSnIMFEpyDA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817483810443264520691.jpeg/HEVJnCDAZn7J7RJuCsCKLpy59DmKMhz40tOGStLThko\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817952645419008592380.jpeg/cEHKsDhpoFegQjTpUCvnThXqUq9eRJ0VbAyFOGwMhTg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817956739190784723651.jpeg/ZNlNi6sGnWmNU56-HvFIkOtVnZLWKzVsqWzImKlsyJg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817960497418240952746.jpeg/4igX_Y9yUadG0gYvIngofphuq7EQugABI9o0RiPaNEY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817963727163392627409.jpeg/MDi2rxAReurGyAOeFenNX5ouRiDV18IsSDiKV0g4ilc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817967191789568716024.jpeg/cU_zs5ojNZfCXDM516P1BawKnF17ofjy04zVv9OM1b8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817952641224704179043.jpeg/twvt_RVM9dgNO4opeJiouBPoF4R1DiqzjvwwjI78MIw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817956231680000547091.jpeg/MNEFnP8SdisvxrvoinrmbWV8sZPxNUJw3Ge089xntPM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817960061210624723068.jpeg/6nTfee4rlIMF9ZM4UuUa5oZjCbIZdmm86dU9punVPaY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817963446145024497263.jpeg/jThuI99Y-vyxcBegoDQSHqa3rbu_xgDff2CkrH9gpKw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817966441009152071986.jpeg/V7g4f1PCftjTYfqwB-hPJ3S_petVUi6rItdxhiLXcYY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817953077432320542708.jpeg/PFUoowhNZXoWxWCPwKqE4bpT4c4AQ_6DrqU7aK6lO2g\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817957435445248397154.jpeg/UJ1A3BRaDTuNo68qxs-O9h604Qjj4ezSmCfYr5gn2K8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817961445330944790325.jpeg/uHak2XyhAfrsG3OamRH6CZTbfcyoBN0J3T0atN09GrQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817966067585024405829.jpeg/3Oc8903ebOgKBO4mgRY8GcO3sle0V4EHyexiu8nsYrs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817969595125760283401.jpeg/fYYaeENxJIhODQwLPmlGHQbkyrFY8D3EXOdtC1znbQs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157817952741888000381624.jpeg/FaWW